#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How customer data is encrypted and how users can delete their personal data."
msgstr "Kung paano ine-encrypt ang data ng customer at kung paano maaaring burahin ng mga user ang kanilang personal na data."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Securing your data"
msgstr "Pag-secure ng iyong data"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Securing your data {#securing-your-data}"
msgstr "Pag-secure ng iyong data {#securing-your-data}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To ensure that you can securely manage your data when you use IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, it is important to know exactly what data is stored and encrypted and how you can delete any stored data.\n"
msgstr "Para masigurado na ligtas mong mapamamahalaan ang iyong data kapag gumagamit ng IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, mahalagang malaman nang eksakto kung anong data ang nakaimbak at ine-encrypt, at kung paano mo mabubura ang anumang nakaimbak na data.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Protecting your sensitive data {#protecting-your-sensitive-data}"
msgstr "Pagprotekta sa iyong sensitibong data {#protecting-your-sensitive-data}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The data that you store in IBM Cloud&reg; is encrypted at rest by using a randomly generated key.\n"
msgstr "Ang data na iniimbak mo sa IBM Cloud&reg; ay ine-encrypt habang nakaimbak gamit ang key na random na binuo.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deleting your data {#deleting-your-data}"
msgstr "Pagbura ng iyong data {#deleting-your-data}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deleting a service instance removes all of the content associated with that instance, such as your jobs, results, parameters, and programs. To delete an instance, from the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), find the instance you want to remove, click its overflow menu, then click **Delete**. You will be asked to confirm the deletion.\n"
msgstr "Inaalis ng pagbura ng service instance ang lahat ng content na nauugnay sa instance na iyon, tulad ng iyong mga job, resulta, parameter, at programa. Para burahin ang isang instance, mula sa [pahina ng Instances,](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) hanapin ang instance na gusto mong alisin, i-click ang overflow menu nito, pagkatapos ay i-click ang **Delete**. Hihilingin sa iyo na kumpirmahin ang pagbura.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have a Manager role, you can also delete an individual job and its data. See more about access policies, groups, and roles in the [documentation](/guides/access-groups).\n"
msgstr "Kung mayroon kang Manager role, maaari ka ring magbura ng isang indibidwal na job at ang data nito. Alamin ang higit pa tungkol sa mga access policy, grupo, at role sa [dokumentasyon](/guides/access-groups).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data retention policy {#data-retention-policy}"
msgstr "Patakaran sa pagpapanatili ng data {#data-retention-policy}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM will retain your (undeleted) data for three years while you are a current user of the service. To find information about how long data is retained by IBM after you stop using the service, see the [IBM Quantum Compute Service data sheet](https://www.ibm.com/support/customer/csol/terms/?id=BB6EE1D06BDE11EBA199CCFE56FA6D9D), found on the IBM Terms site.\n"
msgstr "Itatago ng IBM ang iyong data (na hindi nabura) sa loob ng tatlong taon habang ikaw ay kasalukuyang gumagamit ng serbisyo. Para mahanap ang impormasyon tungkol sa kung gaano katagal pinananatili ng IBM ang data pagkatapos mong itigil ang paggamit ng serbisyo, tingnan ang [IBM Quantum Compute Service data sheet](https://www.ibm.com/support/customer/csol/terms/?id=BB6EE1D06BDE11EBA199CCFE56FA6D9D), na makikita sa IBM Terms site.\n"
